{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-peach-lemonade","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Peach Lemonade","description":"\u003cp\u003eWith Each inhales of Nasty PODMATE Salt PEACH LEMONADE you be greeted by a tangy wave of pink lemonade. It will tickle your tongue and dazzle your taste buds with its sweet and sour flavor profile. On exhale, the sweet side of lemonade will emerge and will give you a perfect end to this tasty sensation and perfectly balance this great flavor out.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf fruity medleys excite your tongue more than anything else, this e-liquid is gonna rock your world. This blissful blend of sweet and tart goodness will rejuvenate in the best ways possible.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Peach Lemonade Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Peach \u0026amp; Lemonade\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652558299191,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Peach Lemonade 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41652558331959,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Peach Lemonade 35 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-podmate-peach-lemonade-salt.jpg?v=1746638875","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/nasty-podmate-nic-salt-peach-lemonade","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




